[{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0010","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0020","text":"怎么了？　树里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0030","text":"就是，下次的企划里\n不是有排球对决吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0040","text":"啊。是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0050","text":"虽然打过排球，\n但都是挺久以前的事了，感觉忘得差不多了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0060","text":"是吗……\n不过，我觉得树里的话肯定没问题的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0070","text":"才没有那回事。我有点担心，\n还是事先练一下比较好吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0072","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0080","text":"──说干就干嘛\n有时间，我去练一会儿"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0090","text":"──啊，不过，关键是没有球……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0100","text":"球的话仓库里有\n随便用"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0110","text":"……还有，方便的话我也一起去行吗？\n至少能帮你拿个球"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0120","text":"诶\n虽然很感谢……可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0130","text":"嗯，偶尔我也想活动活动身体"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0140","text":"嘿咻！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0150","text":"……唔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0160","text":"抱歉，我有点累了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0170","text":"是啊，休息一下吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0180","text":"啊……果然很舒服啊\n活动身体的感觉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0190","text":"树里，你果然打得好啊\n球一直没断过，几乎都不落地"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0200","text":"啊哈哈，那是因为制作人也打得好啦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0210","text":"是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0220","text":"──心情转换得还好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0230","text":"嗯。托你的福"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0240","text":"谢谢你，树里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0241","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0242","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0250","text":"嗯？\n要道谢的话应该是我这边才对吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0260","text":"你能这样认真对待工作、\n做好准备，帮了我大忙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0270","text":"嗯……\n这是理所当然的事啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0280","text":"与其担心“能不能行”，\n像这样实际动起来也能发现很多东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0290","text":"原来如此……那，手感怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0300","text":"嗯，果然练了真好\n感觉手感回来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0310","text":"基本的控球应该没问题了，\n接下来想练一下扣球"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0320","text":"好，那就继续吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0321","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0330","text":"那我练一下配合时机，\n你把球往这边抛过来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0340","text":"好嘞"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0341","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0342","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0350","text":"要上了哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0360","text":"好，来吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0361","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0370","text":"１、２……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0380","text":"漂亮的扣球……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0381","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0390","text":"好！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s41_11000000_01_0400","text":"哈哈，看来不练也没问题啊……！"}]
